bootanim (Boot-time animation)
==============================

A service to run animation scripts under `/etc/bootanim.d/`. Install
animation scripts there to play them during boot.

Set the global tag file environment ("WESTON_FREEZE_DISPLAY" and
"XSERVER_FREEZE_DISPLAY") to freeze the custom display service during
animation.

The service is provided for both SysVinit/busybox (`S31bootanim.sh`) and
systemd (`bootanim.service`).
